category: Libs
requires: libyaramod0 pkg-config pog
sdesc: "Parsing of YARA rules into AST and building new rulesets in C++ (development)"
ldesc: "yaramod is a library that provides parsing of YARA rules into AST and a C++
programming interface to build new YARA rulesets. This project is not
associated with the YARA project."
external-source: yaramod

